' ============================================
' LEGEND (Professional Documentation)
' ============================================
legend bottom left
  **Architecture:** Clean Architecture + Hexagonal Pattern
  
  **Stack:** Next.js 16 + React 19 + Tailwind 4 + Express 5 + PostgreSQL 15 (Supabase) + Gemini AI
  
  **Metrics:** 12 Pages | 6 Hooks | 13 Routes | 9 Middleware | 2 Controllers | 7 Services | 18 Tables
  
  **Patterns:** Repository (BaseService<T>) • Mediator (Orchestrator) • Singleton (Logger, Config, Cache)
  
  **Dual Database Access:**
  • Frontend → Supabase Client → DB (Auth, Real-time subscriptions, RLS)
  • Backend → Supabase Admin → DB (Business logic, Full access, No RLS)
  
  **Colors:**
  🔵 Blue: Frontend internal | 🟠 Orange: Cross-boundary | 🟢 Green: Clean Architecture + DB
  🟡 Yellow: Middleware pipeline | 🟣 Purple: Routes + Orchestration | ⚫ Gray: Infrastructure
  🔴 Red dashed: Tech debt (11/13 routes skip controllers)
  
  **Tech Debt:** EmailController (280 lines), PDFController (597 lines), ScraperController (499 lines)
endlegend

